## intro
Tonight is the Thanksgiving party.
Difficulty: Hard. One more guest lies, the lab analyzer is off, and Garter's door log has a second broken sensor. Half again the pay, and a Good or Perfect solve earns a stronger boost.
The case: a weapon rigged to go off on its own smashed Mrs. Briefs' stand-in in the Study. Whoever set it thought it was the real one.
Inspect the remains in the Study for the damage and the stand-in's last telemetry.
Delayed sabotage: someone rigged the weapon earlier in the night and was somewhere else when it went off. A delay timer at the scene says how long it waited: search the Study for it. Jaco wants the time it was rigged.
Twelve people were at the party: Yamcha, Oolong, Launch, Yajirobe, Mr. Satan, Tien, Gohan, Piccolo, Krillin, Android 18, Dende and Mr. Popo.
