## chart
The seating chart, every place card signed at the feast:
At nine: Android 18, Mr. Popo.
At ten: Yajirobe, Krillin, Android 18.
At eleven: Mr. Satan, Android 18.
At midnight: nobody.
(Finding 2 of the 4 Jaco needs.)
## timer
Taped out of sight, its wires still warm: a Capsule Corp delay timer that fed the weapon. Its dial reads set two chimes before it fired. Whoever rigged it stood here then, and was somewhere else when it went off.
## remains
The damage tells its own story: crushed, not struck, as if the room's gravity leaned on one spot. Either the Gravity Gauntlet from the Robot Workshop, or the Battle Jacket Mk.0 from the Grand Hall. Both are missing.
The stand-in's last telemetry: its heart capsule stopped between eleven and midnight.
## jacket
Shoved out of sight: the empty case of the Battle Jacket Mk.0, its foam still shaped to it. Dr. Briefs keeps it in the Grand Hall, so whoever rigged it took it from there earlier in the night.
## partylog
The stand-ins' party log: at eleven, nothing had gone off yet in the Study.
