## evidence
You find an untouched slice of cake, the fork never lifted. (evidence #1)
You find deep footprints pressed into the carpet pile. (evidence #2)
You find a fork with a smear of birthday frosting. (evidence #3)
You find a trail of light, quick footprints through spilled punch. (evidence #4)
You find a tuft of something that is not dark hair. (evidence #5)
You find a patch of air so still your ki sense slides off it. (evidence #6)
## notebook-end
========================================
GALACTIC PATROL, PARTY INCIDENT REPORT
Case: Mrs. Briefs' stand-in smashed by a rigged weapon, Study
Status: OPEN, 58 minutes left
Difficulty: Hard, one more liar, no lab analyzer, a second broken sensor
Kind: Delayed sabotage. Name when it was rigged, not when it went off.
Wrong accusations: 0 of 3. notebook commands lists every command.
========================================
Season: Thanksgiving.
Leads:
 [x] 1. When: it went off between eleven and midnight; the party log says nothing had gone off at eleven. The delay timer says it was set two chimes before it fired.
 [x] 2. Weapon: the Battle Jacket Mk.0, kept in the Grand Hall. notebook <time> shows who claimed the Grand Hall before it was rigged.
 [x] 3. Physical evidence: 6 of 6 found. search the rooms; the lab analyzer is off on a Hard case. notebook guests shows who looks like what.
      #1 [unverified] an untouched slice of cake, the fork never lifted
      #2 [unverified] deep footprints pressed into the carpet pile
      #3 [unverified] a fork with a smear of birthday frosting
      #4 [unverified] a trail of light, quick footprints through spilled punch
      #5 [unverified] a tuft of something that is not dark hair
      #6 [unverified] a patch of air so still your ki sense slides off it
      Searched: every open room.
 [x] 4. Statements: 12 of 12. question <guest> where they stand; notebook <time> compares them, and read log <time> in the Inner Hall counts heads. Find the one nobody saw when it was rigged.
 [x] 5. Secrets: Launch (confronted); Yajirobe (confronted); Mr. Satan (confronted), a phrase on the back; Tien (confronted)
      Scribbled on the back: "lights out dear".
 [x] 6. Sealed rooms: the lab open; the Gravity Chamber open; Bulma's Suite open.
 [ ] 7. Accuse: 15 of 4 findings. Anywhere in the house: accuse <suspect> with <weapon> rigged at <time>, then accuse yes. accuse alone shows the words.
Weapons: Gravity Gauntlet, Battle Jacket Mk.0, Lights Out Capsule, Dream Ray, Hoi Poi Hornets, Capsule Taser.
Times: nine, ten, eleven, midnight (or 9 to 12).
