## plate
Mrs. Briefs' stand-in checks her list: Piccolo refused the cake.
## accuse
Accuse in one line, anywhere in the house:
  accuse <suspect> with <weapon> rigged at <time>
The time is when it was rigged, not when it went off.
Suspects: yamcha oolong launch yajirobe
          satan tien gohan piccolo
Weapons:  gauntlet jacket lights
          dream hornets taser
Times:    nine ten eleven midnight (or 9 to 12)
Example:  accuse oolong with dream rigged at ten
Short:    accuse oolong dream 10
Then accuse yes makes the arrest.
Findings: 16 of 4. Three wrong and the case goes cold.
## card
Tucked out of sight: a black calling card stamped with a silver top hat, and on the back in neat script, With compliments, the Phantom. It has nothing to do with tonight's case and is no finding, but solve the case in time and the card is yours to keep. Your casebook counts them.
